## Dealer Warranty

Many used car dealerships in California sell vehicles with a dealer warranty. These are much shorter than original manufacturer warranties - and are typically good for 30 days or before 1,000 miles accrue on the odometer.

Used Car Lemon Law Rights

The qualifications of a California lemon must be met within the terms of the dealer warranty to be eligible for a settlement.

“As Is” Agreements

“As is” agreements in a used car sale typically mean there is no lemon law coverage regarding defects. These agreements must be specified on the buyer’s guide under California lemon law.

